<title>USA: CME average feeder steer price.</title>
<headline>CME average feeder steer price.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange reported the average feeder steer price for the seven calendar days ending Wednesday, Dec 18 used for cash settlement of CME Feeder Cattle contracts.</p>
<p>(in dollars per cwt) --</p>
<p>12-STATES - FOR 7 DAYS ENDING -</p>
<p>Wednesday    Dec 18   $65.58    up 0.13</p>
<p>Tuesday	Dec 17   $65.45    dn 0.02</p>
